{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "%@ above the best this charger has recorded. Same charger, so that difference is the cable and the plugs — not the adapter." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比该充电器的最好记录高 %@。充电器相同，所以这个差值来自线缆和插头，不是适配器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比該充電器的最佳紀錄高 %@。充電器相同，所以這個差值來自線材和插頭，不是轉接器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ at the port" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "端口实测 %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "連接埠實測 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld sessions" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld 次充电"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld 次充電"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "at the current draw" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按当前取电"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按目前取電"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cable and connection" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "线缆与连接"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "線材與連線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cable comparison" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "线缆对比"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "線材對比"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Either way this is the whole path — the charger's own regulation, the cable and both plugs — not the cable alone, so it reads best as a comparison between cables on the same charger." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "两种算法给出的都是整条通路——充电器自身的稳压、线缆和两端插头——而不是线缆本身，所以它最适合用来在同一个充电器上横向比较不同的线。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "兩種演算法給出的都是整條通路——充電器自身的穩壓、線材和兩端插頭——而不是線材本身，所以它最適合用來在同一個充電器上橫向比較不同的線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fahrenheit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "华氏度"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "華氏度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fitted over %@ of current swing, with %@ of it on the line." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 %@ 的电流变化范围内拟合，其中 %@ 落在这条直线上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 %@ 的電流變化範圍內擬合，其中 %@ 落在這條直線上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "fitted over the whole contract" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在整段合约上拟合"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在整段合約上擬合"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "from one sample" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "单次采样"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "單次取樣"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From one sample, against the negotiated %@. That figure is a ceiling rather than a measurement, so read this as an order of magnitude. Once the current moves — the taper past 80%, thermal throttling, the phone's own load — it is replaced by a fit that needs no reference at all." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "单次采样，以协商出的 %@ 为参考。那个值是天花板而不是测量值，所以只能当数量级看。一旦电流动起来——80% 之后的涓流、热降频、手机自身的负载——它就会被一个完全不需要参考值的拟合结果取代。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "單次取樣，以協商出的 %@ 為參考。那個值是天花板而不是測量值，所以只能當數量級看。一旦電流動起來——80% 之後的涓流、熱降頻、手機自身的負載——它就會被一個完全不需要參考值的擬合結果取代。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get ${metric}" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "获取${metric}"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "獲取${metric}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get ${metric} in ${unit}" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "获取${metric}（${unit}）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "獲取${metric}（${unit}）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get Reading" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "获取读数"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "獲取讀數"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High for a charging path. A thinner or longer cable, a worn plug or a loose fit all look like this. Trying another cable on the same charger is the way to tell which." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对充电通路来说偏高。线更细、更长，插头磨损，或接触松动，看起来都是这样。在同一个充电器上换一根线，才能分清是哪一种。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "對充電通路來說偏高。線更細、更長，插頭磨損，或接觸鬆動，看起來都是這樣。在同一個充電器上換一根線，才能分清是哪一種。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lost in the path" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通路损耗"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通路損耗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low. Nothing in this connection is holding the charge back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "低。这条连接没有拖慢充电。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "低。這條連線沒有拖慢充電。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "of the current on offer" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "占可用电流"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "佔可用電流"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ordinary for a long or thin cable. It costs a little power as heat, and at these currents it is unlikely to change how fast the phone charges." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对较长或较细的线缆来说很常见。会有少量功率变成热，在这样的电流下不太会影响充电速度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "對較長或較細的線材來說很常見。會有少量功率變成熱，在這樣的電流下不太會影響充電速度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Path resistance" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通路电阻"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通路電阻"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "读数"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "讀數"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads one value from the phone's sensors at the moment the action runs. When a sensor does not answer, the action returns no value — never 0, and never an older reading — so a shortcut can tell the difference." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在动作运行的那一刻从手机传感器读取一个值。传感器没有应答时，动作返回“无值”——不会返回 0，也不会返回之前的读数——这样快捷指令能分辨出来。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在動作執行的那一刻從手機感測器讀取一個值。感測器沒有回應時，動作返回「無值」——不會返回 0，也不會返回之前的讀數——這樣捷徑能分辨出來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取电比例"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取電比例"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature unit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温度单位"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "溫度單位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The lowest path resistance recorded on this charger. Whatever was plugged in here is as good as it has seen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是该充电器上记录到的最低通路电阻。这次用的线和插法，已经是它见过最好的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是該充電器上記錄到的最低通路電阻。這次用的線和插法，已經是它見過最好的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rail is collapsing under load. The phone is taking well under what the charger offered, and the voltage at the port is far below what was negotiated — the current is being held down to stop it falling further. Try another cable on this charger: if the drop shrinks, it was the cable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "供电轨在负载下塌陷。手机取的电远低于充电器给出的额度，端口电压也远低于协商值——电流正被压着，以免电压继续往下掉。在这个充电器上换一根线试试：压降变小，就是线的问题。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "供電軌在負載下塌陷。手機取的電遠低於充電器給出的額度，連接埠電壓也遠低於協商值——電流正被壓著，以免電壓繼續往下掉。在這個充電器上換一根線試試：壓降變小，就是線的問題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voltage at the port has collapsed well below what was negotiated, and the phone is holding the current down to keep it up. That is the cable or the plugs, not the charger." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "端口电压已经塌到远低于协商值，手机正压着电流以维持电压。问题出在线缆或插头，不在充电器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "連接埠電壓已經塌到遠低於協商值，手機正壓著電流以維持電壓。問題出在線材或插頭，不在充電器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "单位"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "單位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voltage drop" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电压损失"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "電壓損失"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the phone to draw enough to measure a drop. Below about 150 mA there is nothing to divide." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待手机取电到足以测出压降。低于约 150 mA 就没有可除的东西了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待手機取電到足以測出壓降。低於約 150 mA 就沒有可除的東西了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless charging has no cable and no input-current sensor, so there is nothing to measure." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线充电没有线缆，也没有输入电流传感器，无从测量。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無線充電沒有線材，也沒有輸入電流感測器，無從測量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "—" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
