    "Charge power below the adapter's rating right now is expected: the limit is the system's, not the charger's." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前充电功率低于适配器额定功率属正常现象：此时的功率限制来自系统温控，而非充电器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目前充電功率低於轉接器額定功率是正常的：此時的功率限制來自系統溫控，不是充電器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "charging" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "充电中"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "充電中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Charging" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "充电中"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "充電中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Charging is on hold, so almost nothing is being drawn. Optimized Battery Charging or a charge limit looks exactly like this." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "充电处于暂停状态，几乎不取电。优化电池充电或充电上限就是这个样子。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "充電處於暫停狀態，幾乎不取電。最佳化電池充電或充電上限就是這個樣子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Charging on hold" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "暂停充电"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "暫停充電"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Charging wirelessly. The charge IC exposes the coil's voltage but no current to pair with it, so the power coming in cannot be measured — only what reaches the cell. The figure the charger reports about itself is a ceiling, not a reading, and does not move." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前为无线充电。充电芯片仅提供了线圈电压，未提供对应电流，因此无法测量输入功率 —— 仅能测量充入电芯的功率。充电器自身报告的数值仅为功率上限而非实时读数，不会发生变化。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "目前為無線充電。充電晶片僅提供了線圈電壓，未提供對應電流，因此無法測量輸入功率 —— 僅能測量充入電芯的功率。充電器自身報告的數值僅為功率上限而非即時讀數，不會發生變化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
