    },
    "System thermal state" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统发热状态"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系統發熱狀態"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The temperatures are measured; the positions are not. iOS reports sensor names and values and no coordinates at all, so each zone is drawn at a fixed spot that follows the usual layout of a recent iPhone — logic board up top behind the cameras, battery through the middle, charge IC by the port. Real layouts differ by model. Read this as a legend for the list below, not as a map of your phone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温度数据为实际测量值，但位置并非如此。iOS 仅报告传感器名称和数值，完全不包含坐标信息，因此各发热区域均按近年 iPhone 的常见布局绘制在固定位置 —— 主板位于上方摄像头后部，电池位于中部，充电芯片位于接口旁。不同机型的实际内部布局存在差异。请将此图作为下方列表的图例参考，而非手机内部的真实地图。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "溫度資料為實際測量值，但位置並非如此。iOS 僅報告感測器名稱和數值，完全不包含座標資訊，因此各發熱區域均按近年 iPhone 的常見佈局繪製在固定位置 —— 主機板位於上方攝像頭後部，電池位於中部，充電晶片位於介面旁。不同機型的實際內部佈局存在差異。請將此圖作為下方列表的圖例參考，不是手機內部的真實地圖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thermal" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发热"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "發熱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thermal throttling active" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温控限制已生效"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "溫控限制已生效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This adapter published no PD profile menu. Legacy USB-A chargers and some wireless pads report only a single voltage and current." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此适配器未广播 PD 供电规格菜单。传统的 USB-A 充电器和部分无线充电板仅报告单个电压和电流。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此轉接器未廣播 PD 供電規格選單。傳統的 USB-A 充電器和部分無線充電板僅報告單一電壓和電流。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
