    },
    "Warming up. Charge current may be trimmed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温度上升中，充电电流可能会被削减。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "溫度上升中，充電電流可能會被削減。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watts" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "功率"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "功率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Well under the adapter's rating while the system is thermally throttling — the ceiling right now is heat, not the charger." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统正在因发热限频，功率远低于适配器额定值——此刻的瓶颈是温度，不是充电器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系統正在因發熱限頻，功率遠低於轉接器額定值——此刻的瓶頸是溫度，不是充電器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wired" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有线"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless charger" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线充电器"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無線充電器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless charging has no input-current sensor, so there is nothing to compare against the rating. The voltage and current below are the profile the pad negotiated — a ceiling that stays put while the actual draw moves." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线充电没有输入电流传感器，因此无法与额定功率进行对比。下方的电压与电流为充电板协商的供电规格 —— 仅作为固定上限，而实际功率则会动态变动。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無線充電沒有輸入電流感測器，因此無法與額定功率進行對比。下方的電壓與電流為充電板協商的供電規格 —— 僅作為固定上限，而實際功率則會動態變動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless charging is capped well below what the adapter could deliver over the cable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线充电的上限远低于同一适配器通过线缆能提供的功率。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無線充電的上限遠低於同一轉接器透過線材能提供的功率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless coil" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线充电线圈"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無線充電線圈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless input" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线输入"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
