          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose all temperatures or one component; the iOS system thermal state is always shown. Together shows power and temperatures at the same time; Separate pages alternates between them every four seconds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温度可选择全部部件或单独一个部件，且始终显示 iOS 系统发热状态。同屏模式同时显示功率和温度；分页轮播模式每四秒切换一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "溫度可選擇全部元件或單獨一個元件，且始終顯示 iOS 系統發熱狀態。同一畫面同時顯示功率和溫度；分頁輪播模式每四秒切換一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Primary readout" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主要读数"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主要讀數"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The compact Dynamic Island shows this reading. Press and hold it to see power, SoC, battery and hottest-component temperatures together." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "灵动岛紧凑状态显示此项读数。长按展开后可同时查看功率、SoC、电池和最高部件温度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "動態島精簡顯示顯示此項讀數。長按展開後可同時檢視功率、SoC、電池和最高元件溫度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The activity starts while a charger is connected and MiniWatts is in front, refreshes while MiniWatts runs, and marks the reading paused once the app is suspended. Unplug with MiniWatts running and it ends two minutes later; unplug while it is suspended and it stays until MiniWatts runs again. Tap End on the activity to close it at any time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接充电器且 MiniWatts 位于前台时会启动实时活动，并在 MiniWatts 运行期间持续刷新；App 被暂停后，读数会标记为已暂停。在 MiniWatts 运行时拔下充电器，两分钟后自动结束；如果拔下时 App 已被暂停，它会一直保留，直到 MiniWatts 再次运行。随时可以点实时活动上的“结束”把它关掉。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "連線充電器且 MiniWatts 位於前景時會啟動即時動態，並在 MiniWatts 執行期間持續重新整理；App 被暫停後，讀數會標記為已暫停。在 MiniWatts 執行時拔下充電器，兩分鐘後自動結束；如果拔下時 App 已被暫停，它會一直保留，直到 MiniWatts 再次執行。隨時可以點一下即時動態上的「結束」把它關掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "End Live Activity" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "结束实时活动"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "結束即時動態"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used only for the %-rate estimate, which is the sole way to see discharge power: no discharge-current sensor is exposed to a sandboxed app. This starts from the published rating for this model, or 15 Wh when that rating is not known. eSIM-only and physical-SIM versions can differ, so change it if you know yours." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅用于百分比变化率估算，这也是查看放电功率的唯一方式：沙盒 App 读不到放电电流。这个数字先用这台手机公开的额定能量，查不到就用 15 Wh。仅 eSIM 版和带实体 SIM 卡的版本容量可能不同，知道实际数字就改掉。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只用在百分比變化率的估算上，這也是看放電功率的唯一辦法：沙盒 App 讀不到放電電流。這個數字先用這支手機公開的額定能量，查不到就用 15 Wh。eSIM 版和實體 SIM 卡版的容量可能不一樣，知道實際數字就改掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
